  //  Numbering follows the natural flow: notebooks first (presentation),
  //  then CRISP-DM phases (DU → DP → Modeling → Evaluation), then the
  //  deployment surface (Inference → API → Extension → Web), then
  //  supporting material (Tests, Docs, Repo root).
